g-term use.\r\nWarning: Do not use when nausea or vomiting are present unless directed by a healthcare professional. Do not use if you have history of, or currently have intestinal disease. Consult a healthcare professional if you have noticed a sudden change in bowel habits that persist over 2 weeks. Rectal bleeding or failure to move bowels after use may indicate a serious condition. If you experience any of these symptoms, discontinue use and consult a healthcare professional.\r\nNotice: This product contains Cascara Sagrada. Read and follow directions carefully. Do not use if you have or develop diarrhea, loose stools, or abdominal pain because Cascara Sagrada may worsen these conditions and be harmful to your health."},{"type":"Precautions re: Pregnant or Nursing or Prescription Medications","notes":"Consult your physician if you have frequent diarrhea, or if you are pregnant, nursing, taking medication, or have a medical condition."},{"type":"Precautions re: Children","notes":"Keep out of reach of children."},{"type":"Precautions re: All Other","notes":"Safety sealed with inner seal. Do not use if seal is broken or missing."},{"type":"Storage","notes":"Keep tightly closed. Store at room temperature. Avoid excessive heat and direct sunlight."},{"type":"Formulation re: Does NOT Contain","notes":"Gluten free. No salt, yeast-derived ingredients, wheat, soy, dairy, or artificial colors, flavors, or preservatives."},{"type":"Brand IP Statement(s) re: (c), (TM), (SM)","notes":"Copyright 2022 Nature's Way Brands, LLC"},{"type":"General Statements: All Other Content","notes":"Bottles made from 97% post-consumer recycled plastic"},{"type":"Formulation re: Vegetarian/Vegan","notes":"Vegan"},{"type":"Seals/Symbols","notes":"Quality Global Sourcing Bottled & Tested in the USA"}],"targetGroups":["Children 4 or More Years of Age","Vegan","Vegetarian","Adult (18 - 50 Years)","Gluten Free","Dairy Free"],"thumbnail":"295107_thumbnail.jpg","upcSku":"0 33674 00930 7","userGroups"